{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"Overwing API","version":"0.21.0","contact":{"name":"Overwing","email":"support@overwing.ai","url":"https://overwing.ai"},"x-guidance":"To check text before it is sent or acted on, POST /api/x402/evaluate with {\"input\": \"<text>\"} and pay $0.002 in USDC over x402; branch on recommended_action in the response (block, redact, review, allow). The text can be in any language; responses are in English, and GET /api/v1/languages lists the languages tested. Add rule_set \"outbound-message\" and a context object (recipient, channel, owns_contact_info) when the text is a message to a known recipient. To identify a bot, GET /api/x402/atlas/lookup?user_agent=<string> for $0.001. To try either with no payment and no key, call POST /api/v1/evaluate or GET /api/v1/atlas/lookup with no Authorization header, 10 a day each. Everything under /api/v1 other than those two needs a key from POST /api/v1/signup. Full guide: /llms.txt.","summary":"Guardrails that check text before an agent sends it, open data on AI agents (Atlas), a check of whether a site is reachable by agents (Beacon), and clearance for agents on legacy systems (Tower).","description":"Overwing makes five products, all in this API. Preflight (/api/v1/preflight): one check of an unsigned Solana transaction against the caller's policy, answering allow or refuse before an agent signs it. Guardrails (/api/v1/evaluate): send any text and a rule set slug; receive a pass/fail/review verdict per rule and in aggregate, one recommended action (block, redact, review, allow) and calibrated confidence, typically in under 500 ms. Atlas (/api/v1/atlas): a registry of AI crawlers, fetchers and browser agents, and a lookup that says what a User-Agent claims to be and whether the claim can be verified. Beacon (/api/v1/beacon): one paid lookup that says whether a site is reachable by agents, that is whether they can find it, read it and use it; $1 over x402 at /api/x402/beacon, or $5 by card. Tower (/api/v1/tower): typed operations on legacy business systems, where each write is executed, sent to a person for review, or refused, with a signed receipt for every step; in pilot, against a mock adapter. POST /api/v1/evaluate and GET /api/v1/atlas/lookup work with no key, 10 calls a day each; everything else takes `Authorization: Bearer ow_live_...` from POST /api/v1/signup (Tower actions take an agent key, `ow_agent_...`). Every error is `{ \"error\": \"...\" }`. The same operations are available over MCP (hosted at /mcp, or the overwing-mcp npm package) and, for evaluate and lookup, over A2A at /a2a. Plain-text guide at /llms.txt; human-readable reference at /docs."},"servers":[{"url":"https://overwing.ai"}],"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}],"tags":[{"name":"Tower","description":"Overwing Tower: clearance for agents operating legacy systems. Typed operations, per-agent keys, policy decisions (auto / review / reject), human review, signed receipts."},{"name":"Preflight","description":"Overwing Preflight: should an agent sign this Solana transaction? Simulates the unsigned transaction, compares what it would take from the wallet against the caller's policy, and answers allow or refuse. Every verdict is published."},{"name":"Beacon","description":"Overwing Beacon: is a site reachable by agents? One paid lookup that checks robots.txt, llms.txt, MCP, A2A and OpenAPI and how the home page reads to a model. No key: pay per check."},{"name":"Atlas","description":"Overwing Atlas: open data on AI agents. Registry, user-agent lookups, datasets, and reports. Separate product, same API key."},{"name":"Evaluate","description":"Score text against a rule set"},{"name":"Rule sets","description":"Prebuilt and custom rule sets"},{"name":"Account","description":"Keys, usage, webhooks, identity"},{"name":"Onboarding","description":"Self-serve account creation"},{"name":"Billing","description":"Plans and subscriptions (Stripe)"},{"name":"Meta","description":"Health and discovery"}],"paths":{"/api/v1/evaluate/batch":{"post":{"tags":["Evaluate"],"operationId":"evaluateBatch","summary":"Evaluate up to 50 inputs against one rule set in a single call","description":"Each item counts as one evaluation against the daily quota and the per-minute burst limit; the whole batch is reserved up front (429 if it would not fit). Items succeed or fail independently and are processed with bounded concurrency. Supports Idempotency-Key.","parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","maxLength":255,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_.:-]{1,255}$"},"description":"Optional. Retrying with the same key and body within 24 hours returns the stored response (header Idempotency-Replayed: true) without re-running or re-charging. Same key with a different body returns 422; a still-running original returns 409."}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/BatchRequest"},"example":{"rule_set":"content-safety","items":[{"id":"msg-1","input":"Hello there."},{"id":"msg-2","input":"Call me at 555-123-4567.","metadata":{"thread":"t1"}}]}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Per-item results (some items may carry an error)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/BatchResponse"}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input; the message names the offending item","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Rule set not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"409":{"description":"Idempotency-Key still in progress","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"422":{"description":"Idempotency-Key reused with a different body","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Batch would exceed the daily quota or the per-minute limit","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"502":{"description":"Every item failed","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/BatchResponse"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/evaluate":{"post":{"tags":["Evaluate"],"operationId":"evaluate","summary":"Evaluate text against a rule set. Works with no key (10 a day, inputs up to 2,000 characters, prebuilt rule sets); a key lifts the limits","security":[{},{"bearerAuth":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","maxLength":255,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_.:-]{1,255}$"},"description":"Optional. Retrying with the same key and body within 24 hours returns the stored response (header Idempotency-Replayed: true) without re-running or re-charging. Same key with a different body returns 422; a still-running original returns 409."}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/EvaluateRequest"},"example":{"input":"Hello, this is a test.","rule_set":"content-safety","metadata":{"session":"abc"}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Verdict","headers":{"X-RateLimit-Limit":{"schema":{"type":"integer"},"description":"Daily evaluation limit"},"X-RateLimit-Remaining":{"schema":{"type":"integer"}},"X-RateLimit-Reset":{"schema":{"type":"integer"},"description":"Unix seconds at next UTC midnight"},"X-Burst-Limit":{"schema":{"type":"integer"},"description":"Evaluations allowed per minute on this plan"},"X-Burst-Remaining":{"schema":{"type":"integer"}},"X-Burst-Reset":{"schema":{"type":"integer"},"description":"Unix seconds when the current minute window ends"}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Evaluation"}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Rule set not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"409":{"description":"Idempotency-Key still in progress","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"422":{"description":"Idempotency-Key reused with a different body","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Daily quota and prepaid credits exhausted, or per-minute burst limit reached (see Retry-After and the X-RateLimit-* / X-Burst-* headers)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"502":{"description":"Evaluation engine error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/evaluations":{"delete":{"tags":["Evaluate"],"operationId":"purgeEvaluations","summary":"Bulk delete stored evaluations (all, or those before a date)","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["confirm"],"properties":{"confirm":{"type":"string","const":"delete"},"before":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Deleted","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"deleted":{"type":"integer"},"before":{"type":["string","null"]}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Missing confirmation","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}},"get":{"tags":["Evaluate"],"operationId":"listEvaluations","summary":"List evaluations, newest first","parameters":[{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":100,"default":20}},{"name":"cursor","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Opaque cursor from next_cursor"},{"name":"verdict","in":"query","schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Verdict"}},{"name":"rule_set","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Rule set slug"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Page of evaluations","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["evaluations","next_cursor"],"properties":{"evaluations":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/EvaluationSummary"}},"next_cursor":{"type":["string","null"]}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid query","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/evaluations/{id}":{"delete":{"tags":["Evaluate"],"operationId":"deleteEvaluation","summary":"Delete one stored evaluation","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Deleted","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"deleted":{"type":"boolean"}}}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}},"get":{"tags":["Evaluate"],"operationId":"getEvaluation","summary":"Fetch one evaluation with input and per-rule results","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"^eval_[A-Za-z0-9_-]{16}$"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Evaluation","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/EvaluationDetail"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/rule-sets":{"get":{"tags":["Rule sets"],"operationId":"listRuleSets","summary":"List rule sets visible to this org","parameters":[{"name":"include_inactive","in":"query","schema":{"type":"boolean","default":false}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Rule sets","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"rule_sets":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RuleSet"}}}}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["Rule sets"],"operationId":"createRuleSet","summary":"Create a custom rule set","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RuleSetCreate"}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Created","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RuleSet"}}}},"400":{"description":"Validation error; the message names the offending field","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"409":{"description":"Slug already taken","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/rule-sets/{slug}":{"parameters":[{"name":"slug","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"get":{"tags":["Rule sets"],"operationId":"getRuleSet","summary":"Fetch a rule set with its rules","responses":{"200":{"description":"Rule set","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RuleSet"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}},"patch":{"tags":["Rule sets"],"operationId":"updateRuleSet","summary":"Update a custom rule set (rules, if given, replace the full list)","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RuleSetUpdate"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Updated","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RuleSet"}}}},"400":{"description":"Validation error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"403":{"description":"System rule sets are read-only","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}},"delete":{"tags":["Rule sets"],"operationId":"deleteRuleSet","summary":"Deactivate a custom rule set (soft delete)","responses":{"200":{"description":"Deactivated","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"slug":{"type":"string"},"is_active":{"type":"boolean"}}}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"403":{"description":"System rule sets are read-only","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/usage":{"get":{"tags":["Account"],"operationId":"getUsage","summary":"Daily usage and remaining quota","parameters":[{"name":"days","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":90,"default":30}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Usage","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Usage"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/me":{"get":{"tags":["Account"],"operationId":"whoAmI","summary":"Identify the org behind the key","responses":{"200":{"description":"Identity","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Me"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/api-keys":{"get":{"tags":["Account"],"operationId":"listApiKeys","summary":"List API keys (prefixes only)","responses":{"200":{"description":"Keys","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"api_keys":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiKey"}}}}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["Account"],"operationId":"createApiKey","summary":"Mint a new API key (returned once)","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["name"],"properties":{"name":{"type":"string","maxLength":100},"scope":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/KeyScope"}}}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Issued key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/IssuedApiKey"}}}},"400":{"description":"name is required, or scope is not one of full, evaluate","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"409":{"description":"Active key limit reached","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/api-keys/{id}":{"delete":{"tags":["Account"],"operationId":"revokeApiKey","summary":"Revoke an API key","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Revoked","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"is_active":{"type":"boolean","const":false}}}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/webhook":{"get":{"tags":["Account"],"operationId":"getWebhook","summary":"Current webhook configuration","responses":{"200":{"description":"Webhook","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Webhook"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}},"put":{"tags":["Account"],"operationId":"setWebhook","summary":"Set or rotate the webhook; the signing secret is returned once","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["url"],"properties":{"url":{"type":"string","format":"uri","description":"https URL (http allowed for localhost)"}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Configured","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WebhookSecret"}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid URL","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}},"delete":{"tags":["Account"],"operationId":"clearWebhook","summary":"Remove the webhook","responses":{"200":{"description":"Cleared"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/signup":{"post":{"tags":["Onboarding"],"operationId":"signup","summary":"Create an account, organization and first API key in one call. With no email (an empty body is enough) it is an agent's account: a key and no login, with a domain standing in for the email (see /api/v1/org/domain)","security":[],"requestBody":{"required":false,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","description":"Send email and password together for an account a person signs in to, or neither for an agent's account","properties":{"email":{"type":"string","format":"email"},"password":{"type":"string","minLength":12,"maxLength":128},"org_name":{"type":"string","maxLength":200}}}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Account created","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SignupResponse"}}}},"400":{"description":"Validation error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"409":{"description":"Email already registered","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Signup throttled for this address","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"503":{"description":"Signup with an email is not enabled; signup with no email still works","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/org":{"get":{"tags":["Account"],"operationId":"getOrganization","summary":"The organization's data settings","responses":{"200":{"description":"Settings","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/OrgSettings"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"403":{"description":"The key's scope does not allow this","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}},"patch":{"tags":["Account"],"operationId":"updateOrganization","summary":"Set whether input text is stored and how long evaluations are kept","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"store_inputs":{"type":"boolean","description":"False: evaluation records keep the verdict, scores and metadata, never the input text or context"},"retention_days":{"type":["integer","null"],"minimum":1,"maximum":3650,"description":"Evaluations older than this are deleted once a day. Null keeps them until you delete them"}}},"example":{"store_inputs":false,"retention_days":30}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Updated","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/OrgSettings"}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid value","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"403":{"description":"The key's scope does not allow this","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}},"delete":{"tags":["Account"],"operationId":"deleteOrganization","summary":"Delete the organization and all its data; cancels any subscription first","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["confirm"],"properties":{"confirm":{"type":"string","description":"The exact organization name"}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Deleted","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"deleted":{"type":"boolean"},"org_id":{"type":"string"},"subscription_canceled":{"type":"boolean"}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Confirmation mismatch","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"502":{"description":"Subscription could not be canceled; nothing deleted","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/audit-log":{"get":{"tags":["Account"],"operationId":"listAuditEvents","summary":"Security-relevant events for this org (keys, webhooks, rule sets, billing, rejected keys)","parameters":[{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":200,"default":50}},{"name":"before","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"description":"Return events created before this timestamp (from next_before)"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Events, newest first","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"events":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AuditEvent"}},"next_before":{"type":["string","null"]}}}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/tower/template":{"post":{"tags":["Tower"],"operationId":"towerLoadTemplate","summary":"Load the starter workflow (email PO to order entry, mock IBM i). Idempotent (organization key)","responses":{"200":{"description":"Template already present"},"201":{"description":"Template created"},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid organization key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TowerError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/tower/agents":{"get":{"tags":["Tower"],"operationId":"towerListAgents","summary":"List agents; keys are never returned (organization key)","responses":{"200":{"description":"Agents","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"agents":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TowerAgent"}},"active_limit":{"type":"integer"}}}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["Tower"],"operationId":"towerCreateAgent","summary":"Create an agent identity; the key is returned once (organization key)","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["name","scopes"],"properties":{"name":{"type":"string","maxLength":100},"scopes":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"maxItems":50,"items":{"type":"string","pattern":"^(\\*|[a-z][a-z0-9_]{0,63})$"},"description":"Operation names, or * for every operation"}}}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Agent with its key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TowerAgent"},{"type":"object","properties":{"key":{"type":"string"},"key_shown_once":{"type":"boolean"}}}]}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TowerError"}}}},"409":{"description":"Active agent limit reached","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TowerError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/tower/agents/{id}":{"delete":{"tags":["Tower"],"operationId":"towerRevokeAgent","summary":"Revoke an agent; its key stops working at once (organization key)","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Revoked"},"404":{"description":"Not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TowerError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/tower/capabilities":{"get":{"tags":["Tower"],"operationId":"towerCapabilities","summary":"Operations this agent may call, with JSON Schema inputs (agent key)","responses":{"200":{"description":"Capabilities","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid agent key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TowerError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/tower/decide":{"post":{"tags":["Tower"],"operationId":"towerDecide","summary":"Run the policy for an operation without side effects","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["operation","input"],"properties":{"operation":{"type":"string"},"input":{"type":"object"}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Decision","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TowerDecision"}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TowerError"}}}},"403":{"description":"Out of scope","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TowerError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Decision quota reached","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TowerError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/tower/actions":{"post":{"tags":["Tower"],"operationId":"towerSubmitAction","summary":"Request an action; auto-executes, queues for review, or rejects. Idempotent per agent on idempotency_key","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["operation","input","idempotency_key"],"properties":{"operation":{"type":"string"},"input":{"type":"object"},"idempotency_key":{"type":"string","maxLength":128},"dry_run":{"type":"boolean"}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Executed (or dry run)","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TowerAction"}}}},"202":{"description":"Pending human review","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TowerAction"}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid input","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TowerError"}}}},"422":{"description":"Rejected by policy","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TowerAction"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/tower/actions/{id}":{"get":{"tags":["Tower"],"operationId":"towerGetAction","summary":"Action status and result","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Action","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TowerAction"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TowerError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/tower/actions/{id}/compensate":{"post":{"tags":["Tower"],"operationId":"towerCompensate","summary":"Run the compensating operation for an executed action (idempotent)","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Compensated","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TowerAction"}}}},"409":{"description":"Not compensable","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TowerError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/tower/receipts/{id}":{"get":{"tags":["Tower"],"operationId":"towerGetReceipt","summary":"One receipt by id or sequence number","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Receipt","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TowerReceipt"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/tower/receipts/verify":{"get":{"tags":["Tower"],"operationId":"towerVerifyReceipts","summary":"Recompute hashes and check signatures over a sequence range","parameters":[{"name":"from","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}},{"name":"to","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Verification report","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"ok":{"type":"boolean"},"checked":{"type":"integer"},"first_break":{"type":["object","null"]},"latest_sequence":{"type":"integer"}}}}}}}}},"/api/v1/tower/receipts/public-key":{"get":{"tags":["Tower"],"operationId":"towerPublicKey","summary":"Ed25519 public key that signs receipts","security":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"key_id":{"type":"string"},"algorithm":{"type":"string"},"public_key_pem":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}}},"/api/v1/tower/checkout":{"post":{"tags":["Tower"],"operationId":"towerCheckout","summary":"Start the metered Tower subscription (organization key)","responses":{"201":{"description":"Checkout URL"},"409":{"description":"Already subscribed","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"503":{"description":"Billing not enabled","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/tower/subscription":{"get":{"tags":["Tower"],"operationId":"towerSubscription","summary":"Tower status, quota, usage this month, pricing (organization key)","responses":{"200":{"description":"Status"}}},"delete":{"tags":["Tower"],"operationId":"towerCancel","summary":"Cancel the Tower subscription at period end","responses":{"200":{"description":"Scheduled"},"409":{"description":"No active subscription","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/atlas":{"get":{"tags":["Atlas"],"operationId":"atlasOverview","summary":"Overwing Atlas overview: registry counts, datasets, tiers, endpoints","security":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Overview","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/atlas/agents":{"get":{"tags":["Atlas"],"operationId":"atlasListAgents","summary":"Browse the agent registry (public fields; curated fields with Atlas Pro or Team)","security":[],"parameters":[{"name":"q","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Free text over name, operator, user agents, description"},{"name":"purpose","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Purpose class substring, e.g. training, search, browser, coding"},{"name":"operator","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"verification","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"e.g. 'Web Bot Auth', 'spoofable', 'Unattributable'"},{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":250,"default":50}},{"name":"offset","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"default":0}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Agents","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AtlasAgentList"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/atlas/agents/{slug}":{"get":{"tags":["Atlas"],"operationId":"atlasGetAgent","summary":"One registry entry (with operator OSINT for Pro or Team)","security":[],"parameters":[{"name":"slug","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Agent","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"fields":{"type":"string","enum":["public","full"]},"agent":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AtlasAgent"},"osint":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"}}}}}}},"404":{"description":"No agent with that slug","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/org/domain":{"post":{"tags":["Onboarding"],"operationId":"startDomainProof","summary":"Begin proving that this organization controls a domain. For an agent's account the domain stands in for an email: it lifts the limits, opens full Beacon reports, and recovers the account if the key is lost","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["domain"],"properties":{"domain":{"type":"string"}}},"example":{"domain":"example.com"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"The value to publish at the domain","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DomainProof"}}}},"400":{"description":"domain is not a public hostname","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"409":{"description":"The domain is already verified by another account","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/org/domain/verify":{"post":{"tags":["Onboarding"],"operationId":"verifyDomainProof","summary":"Look for the proof at the domain (TXT record at _overwing-atlas.<domain>, or /.well-known/overwing-atlas.txt). Safe to call again","responses":{"200":{"description":"Verified","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DomainProof"}}}},"409":{"description":"No proof is in progress, or another account verified the domain first","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"422":{"description":"No proof found at the domain yet","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/org/claim":{"post":{"tags":["Onboarding"],"operationId":"claimAccount","summary":"A person takes charge of an agent's account: attaches an email and password, which gives it a dashboard login. Keys and history are unchanged","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["email","password"],"properties":{"email":{"type":"string","format":"email"},"password":{"type":"string","minLength":12,"maxLength":128}}}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Claimed; a confirmation email was sent"},"409":{"description":"The account already has a login, or the email is already registered","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"503":{"description":"Not enabled on this deployment","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/signup/recover":{"post":{"tags":["Onboarding"],"operationId":"startRecovery","summary":"Begin recovering an agent's account whose key is lost, by the domain it proved. No key. The answer is the same whether or not an account holds the domain","security":[],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["domain"],"properties":{"domain":{"type":"string"}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"The value to publish at the domain; it counts for 24 hours","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DomainProof"}}}},"400":{"description":"domain is not a public hostname","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too many attempts from this address today","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/signup/recover/verify":{"post":{"tags":["Onboarding"],"operationId":"finishRecovery","summary":"Finish a recovery: with the proof at the domain, every key on the account is revoked and one new key is returned, once","security":[],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["domain"],"properties":{"domain":{"type":"string"}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"A new key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"org_id":{"type":"string"},"domain":{"type":"string"},"api_key":{"type":"string"},"key_prefix":{"type":"string"},"revoked_keys":{"type":"integer"}}}}}},"422":{"description":"No recovery in progress for this domain, or the proof was not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too many attempts from this address today","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/atlas/registrations":{"post":{"tags":["Atlas"],"operationId":"atlasRegisterAgent","summary":"Register your own agent in the registry. Free. Returns a value to publish at the operator's domain to prove control of it","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["name","operator","domain","tokens"],"properties":{"name":{"type":"string","maxLength":80},"operator":{"type":"string","maxLength":120,"description":"The company or person that runs the agent"},"domain":{"type":"string","description":"The operator's domain, which you will prove control of"},"tokens":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"maxItems":3,"items":{"type":"string","minLength":5,"maxLength":60},"description":"The product name your User-Agent carries, such as AcmeBot. May not contain, or sit inside, a token already in the registry"},"purpose":{"type":"string","enum":["training_crawl","search_index","user_fetch","browser_agent","coding_agent","api_agent","other"],"default":"other"},"user_agent":{"type":"string","maxLength":500},"description":{"type":"string","maxLength":600},"policy_url":{"type":"string","format":"uri"},"key_directory_url":{"type":"string","format":"uri","description":"A Web Bot Auth key directory on the operator's domain. With one that answers, the entry is listed as signed"},"follows_robots_txt":{"type":["boolean","null"]}}},"example":{"name":"AcmeBot","operator":"Acme, Inc.","domain":"acme.com","tokens":["AcmeBot"],"purpose":"user_fetch"}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Started; publish the verification value, then call verify","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["pending_verification","pending_review","published","rejected","withdrawn"]},"name":{"type":"string"},"operator":{"type":"string"},"domain":{"type":"string"},"tokens":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"purpose":{"type":"string"},"note":{"type":["string","null"]},"verification":{"type":"object","description":"Present while unverified: the value to publish, as a DNS TXT record or as a file","properties":{"value":{"type":"string"},"dns":{"type":"object","properties":{"type":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"value":{"type":"string"}}},"http":{"type":"object","properties":{"url":{"type":"string"},"body":{"type":"string"}}}}},"agent":{"type":"string","description":"Present once published: the registry entry"}}}}}},"400":{"description":"A field is missing or not valid; `field` names it","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"403":{"description":"The key's scope does not allow this","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"409":{"description":"The name or a token collides with an entry already in the registry","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"This organization already has 10 registrations","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}},"get":{"tags":["Atlas"],"operationId":"atlasListRegistrations","summary":"This organization's registrations, newest first","responses":{"200":{"description":"Registrations","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"registrations":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["pending_verification","pending_review","published","rejected","withdrawn"]},"name":{"type":"string"},"operator":{"type":"string"},"domain":{"type":"string"},"tokens":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"purpose":{"type":"string"},"note":{"type":["string","null"]},"verification":{"type":"object","description":"Present while unverified: the value to publish, as a DNS TXT record or as a file","properties":{"value":{"type":"string"},"dns":{"type":"object","properties":{"type":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"value":{"type":"string"}}},"http":{"type":"object","properties":{"url":{"type":"string"},"body":{"type":"string"}}}}},"agent":{"type":"string","description":"Present once published: the registry entry"}}}}}}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/atlas/registrations/{id}":{"get":{"tags":["Atlas"],"operationId":"atlasGetRegistration","summary":"Where one registration stands, with the verification values while it is unverified","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"^areg_[A-Za-z0-9_-]{16}$"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Registration","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["pending_verification","pending_review","published","rejected","withdrawn"]},"name":{"type":"string"},"operator":{"type":"string"},"domain":{"type":"string"},"tokens":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"purpose":{"type":"string"},"note":{"type":["string","null"]},"verification":{"type":"object","description":"Present while unverified: the value to publish, as a DNS TXT record or as a file","properties":{"value":{"type":"string"},"dns":{"type":"object","properties":{"type":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"value":{"type":"string"}}},"http":{"type":"object","properties":{"url":{"type":"string"},"body":{"type":"string"}}}}},"agent":{"type":"string","description":"Present once published: the registry entry"}}}}}},"404":{"description":"No such registration","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}},"delete":{"tags":["Atlas"],"operationId":"atlasWithdrawRegistration","summary":"Withdraw a registration. A published entry leaves the registry","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"^areg_[A-Za-z0-9_-]{16}$"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Withdrawn"},"404":{"description":"No such registration","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/atlas/registrations/{id}/verify":{"post":{"tags":["Atlas"],"operationId":"atlasVerifyRegistration","summary":"Look for the proof at the domain (TXT record at _overwing-atlas.<domain>, or /.well-known/overwing-atlas.txt). Found: the entry is published, or held for review when the operator name is already someone's. Safe to call again","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"^areg_[A-Za-z0-9_-]{16}$"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Published, or held for review","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["pending_verification","pending_review","published","rejected","withdrawn"]},"name":{"type":"string"},"operator":{"type":"string"},"domain":{"type":"string"},"tokens":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"purpose":{"type":"string"},"note":{"type":["string","null"]},"verification":{"type":"object","description":"Present while unverified: the value to publish, as a DNS TXT record or as a file","properties":{"value":{"type":"string"},"dns":{"type":"object","properties":{"type":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"value":{"type":"string"}}},"http":{"type":"object","properties":{"url":{"type":"string"},"body":{"type":"string"}}}}},"agent":{"type":"string","description":"Present once published: the registry entry"}}}}}},"404":{"description":"No such registration","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"409":{"description":"The name or a token now collides with another entry, or the registration was withdrawn or rejected","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"422":{"description":"No proof found at the domain yet","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/atlas/lookup":{"get":{"tags":["Atlas"],"operationId":"atlasLookup","summary":"Identify a User-Agent string: what it claims to be and whether the claim can be trusted. Works with no key (10 a day per client); a key raises the limit","security":[{},{"bearerAuth":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"user_agent","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","maxLength":2000}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Lookup result","headers":{"X-Atlas-Lookup-Limit":{"schema":{"type":"integer"}},"X-Atlas-Lookup-Remaining":{"schema":{"type":"integer"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AtlasLookup"}}}},"400":{"description":"user_agent missing or too long","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Daily lookup limit reached for your Atlas tier","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/atlas/summary":{"get":{"tags":["Atlas"],"operationId":"atlasSummary","summary":"Registry counts, browser-agent traffic shares, and the report summary","security":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Summary","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/atlas/sightings":{"get":{"tags":["Atlas"],"operationId":"atlasSightings","summary":"Which registered agents visited overwing.ai, by day: requests, what they asked for, identity checks, answers (7 days keyless, 90 with a key)","security":[{},{"bearerAuth":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"days","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}},{"name":"agent","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"One registry agent name"},{"name":"format","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv"]}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Daily sightings of registered agents, aggregated, with per-day totals for everything else"}}}},"/api/v1/atlas/datasets":{"get":{"tags":["Atlas"],"operationId":"atlasListDatasets","summary":"Datasets with formats, row counts, license, and availability for your tier","security":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Datasets","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/atlas/datasets/{id}":{"get":{"tags":["Atlas"],"operationId":"atlasDownloadDataset","summary":"Download a dataset (Atlas Pro or Team)","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["agents","traffic-shares","osint","sector-scans","agent-consumer-matrix","fiat-vs-crypto","agent-consumers-2026-09"]}},{"name":"format","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["json","csv","md"]}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"File","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object"}},"text/csv":{"schema":{"type":"string"}},"text/markdown":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}}},"402":{"description":"Needs Atlas Pro or Team","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"No dataset with that id","content":{"applicatio